                    <value>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: tahoma; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(7, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;Multimodality Examples for Financial Services&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://salesforce.vidyard.com/watch/XcZhffVMkqL8PTFoax2y7C&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(1, 118, 211); font-size: 18px; font-family: tahoma;&quot;&gt;Meeting Wrap-Up Using Handwritten Notes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this video, Agentforce will &lt;strong&gt;scan an image of a set of hand-written meeting notes&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;create a draft for your confirmation, create the meeting in Salesforce&lt;/strong&gt; along with the &lt;strong&gt;corresponding Tasks&lt;/strong&gt; with appropriate due dates AND &lt;strong&gt;send an email to the Customer&lt;/strong&gt; with the notes. &lt;strong&gt;ALL OFF MOBILE&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://salesforce.vidyard.com/watch/Cww4QPRciB8fR8pDW93291&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(1, 118, 211); font-size: 18px; font-family: tahoma;&quot;&gt;Real-Time File Analysis&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this video, you&apos;ll see a few examples of how &lt;strong&gt;Agentforce is able to ingest images&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;strong&gt;analyze the content&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;real-time&lt;/strong&gt; into providing a &lt;strong&gt;description of the content&lt;/strong&gt; of the images. The Agentforce-generated descriptions can be saved to Salesforce for easy references going forward.&lt;/p&gt;</value>
